      "id": "claim_8a4e69b913b04440979a62e24959ba89",
      "statement": "The dashboard agent-turn flow creates a decision session when needed, streams chat through the main backend to the AI runtime, persists the user message before inference, and persists the assistant envelope after a valid response is received, while the dashboard reconstructs visible products, reasoning, logs, and modal state from the returned envelope.",
