      "id": "claim_6fd7cb2ef4344a6d9d07e77514e72571",
      "statement": "The AI runtime is stateless with respect to decision sessions: for each chat request it loads catalog results and optional offer comparisons from backend tools, builds a strict JSON-schema LLM prompt from backend data plus conversation history, and retries invalid model output up to two self-correction attempts before the API returns failure.",
